WEBVTT

00:04.921 --> 00:07.924
We still have time before
our appointment with the principal.

00:08.008 --> 00:09.634
Do you want to take a short detour?

00:09.718 --> 00:12.846
No, I should be early once in a while.

00:17.100 --> 00:17.934
Stop the car.

00:18.018 --> 00:19.853
What? Right here?

00:20.478 --> 00:22.397
-You can go first.
-What?

00:22.480 --> 00:24.774
Is this some kind of test?

00:24.858 --> 00:27.193
Are you going to beat me up if I leave?

00:27.277 --> 00:28.945
Who do you think I am?

00:29.029 --> 00:30.572
Okay, I'll leave then.

00:39.497 --> 00:40.457
Well then…

00:48.506 --> 00:51.092
Who are you?

01:16.868 --> 01:20.622
What a shame. He was nothing much.

01:20.705 --> 01:21.706
What?

01:26.753 --> 01:28.171
Who's…

01:30.215 --> 01:32.091
nothing much?

01:33.802 --> 01:35.929
Darn brat.

01:36.554 --> 01:40.141
It's a Cursed Spirit
but it can communicate well.

01:41.392 --> 01:43.812
On top of that, this cursed energy…

01:44.437 --> 01:46.648
It's an unregistered
Special Grade Cursed Spirit.

01:48.149 --> 01:50.860
It's probably stronger
than Sukuna's current strength.

01:52.445 --> 01:56.157
Special Grade is called so
because it's special.

01:56.241 --> 01:59.744
Even I would be in a fix
if you just came at me like that.

02:01.579 --> 02:04.249
Is your pride hurt?

02:04.332 --> 02:05.625
No.

02:06.668 --> 02:08.628
I'm starting to have fun.

03:42.722 --> 03:45.683
You're starting to have fun, huh?

03:45.767 --> 03:49.187
You have no sense of crisis.

03:49.771 --> 03:52.649
He purposely attacked
when no one's around.

03:53.775 --> 03:54.859
No.

03:55.902 --> 03:58.780
It's to prevent other sorcerers
from coming to help.

03:59.739 --> 04:00.907
Ember Insects!

04:01.866 --> 04:05.370
But if you're targeting me…

04:05.453 --> 04:07.580
You're right about having
no sense of crisis.

04:12.335 --> 04:15.463
What will happen if this hits me?

04:19.801 --> 04:20.927
The sounds…

04:27.350 --> 04:30.144
A two-stage attack using sound
and explosion.

04:30.228 --> 04:31.938
That's clever of you.

04:38.403 --> 04:40.697
It's not over yet!

04:47.161 --> 04:49.038
Is that all?

04:49.122 --> 04:52.583
To put it bluntly,
you're overly acclaimed by the weak.

04:52.667 --> 04:56.004
Humans nowadays are really fake.

04:56.587 --> 05:01.467
They live in falsehood,
the ugliness of it makes me sick!

05:02.051 --> 05:07.265
Let your death prove
the real strength and truth.

05:08.016 --> 05:09.475
-Didn't you…
-What?

05:09.559 --> 05:11.394
…said that just now?

05:11.477 --> 05:12.895
Why don't you learn?

05:12.979 --> 05:13.896
All the ashes…

05:17.150 --> 05:18.860
What's going on?

05:18.943 --> 05:20.194
Well…

05:20.278 --> 05:22.822
In short, you missed.

05:22.905 --> 05:25.908
Impossible.
It's different from the one before.

05:25.992 --> 05:28.286
I did touch and kill you.

05:28.369 --> 05:33.291
What you touched was
the Infinity between you and me.

05:33.374 --> 05:34.459
What?

05:34.542 --> 05:35.793
Let me show you.

05:36.502 --> 05:37.795
Give me your hand.

05:39.881 --> 05:41.299
Come on.

05:42.884 --> 05:44.802
Come on.

05:45.678 --> 05:49.307
There's no intention to kill.
I guess I'll test him out.

05:56.773 --> 05:57.899
You see?

05:59.484 --> 06:02.945
I can't touch him.
My hand stopped in between.

06:03.446 --> 06:05.865
Is this Infinity?

06:05.948 --> 06:08.159
You didn't really stop.

06:08.242 --> 06:10.870
Instead, your movements got slower
as you got closer to me.

06:11.454 --> 06:13.331
What do you think?

06:13.414 --> 06:17.293
I can shake hands with you like this.

06:18.252 --> 06:19.796
I refuse!

06:19.879 --> 06:21.798
Don't be shy.

06:22.381 --> 06:24.759
I'll be embarrassed too.

06:26.094 --> 06:27.720
Damn you!

06:32.642 --> 06:33.893
He's quick.

06:33.976 --> 06:37.021
His blows are not just reinforced
with cursed energy.

06:37.105 --> 06:40.983
Why? I don't understand,
but I've got to figure it out!

06:41.067 --> 06:42.819
It's not over yet!

06:48.157 --> 06:51.494
Infinity is everywhere.

06:52.161 --> 06:55.915
It's just that I brought it
into reality with sorcery.

06:56.666 --> 06:58.835
Convergence. Divergence.

06:59.335 --> 07:01.754
What do you think happens
if you touch this void?

07:02.964 --> 07:04.298
Cursed Technique Reversal…

07:05.007 --> 07:06.008
Red.

07:51.888 --> 07:53.431
Oh, it's just right.

07:56.309 --> 07:57.602
I can give it to you.

07:58.603 --> 08:01.147
But you'll die, Jogo.

08:08.279 --> 08:11.365
I guess that wasn't a lie.

08:13.493 --> 08:18.414
But since I can't hit him,
I'll just drag him to the domain.

08:20.625 --> 08:21.959
Where is he?

08:23.085 --> 08:24.378
Sorry.

08:24.462 --> 08:25.296
What?

08:25.379 --> 08:26.214
Where am I?

08:26.297 --> 08:27.924
Hey! Where am I?

08:28.007 --> 08:30.218
-What?
-Did you wait long?

08:30.301 --> 08:31.928
That guy is…

08:32.011 --> 08:33.638
Sukuna's vessel.

08:33.721 --> 08:36.432
This is Yuji Itadori,
and he's here to observe.

08:36.516 --> 08:37.683
It's Mount Fuji!

08:37.767 --> 08:39.185
His head looks like Mount Fuji!

08:47.527 --> 08:49.403
I'll protect you.

08:49.987 --> 08:51.364
I won't leave you!

08:52.365 --> 08:53.658
Sam…

08:59.163 --> 09:00.790
What?

09:00.873 --> 09:03.376
He learns surprisingly fast.

09:03.876 --> 09:05.545
-Let's go.
-Yuji.

09:07.880 --> 09:09.173
Mr. Gojo!

09:09.840 --> 09:12.176
There's no problem talking to him either.

09:12.260 --> 09:13.719
What's the matter?

09:13.803 --> 09:17.640
Seems like I can increase the output
and proceed to the next stage.

09:17.723 --> 09:19.475
We're going out, Yuji.

09:19.559 --> 09:20.393
What?

09:20.476 --> 09:22.270
Time for an extracurricular lesson.

09:22.353 --> 09:26.023
I'll teach you the apex of sorcery battle,

09:26.649 --> 09:28.192
Domain Expansion.

09:32.947 --> 09:35.825
Why won't we sink?

09:36.409 --> 09:40.454
I was still in school ten seconds ago,
right, Mr. Gojo?

09:40.538 --> 09:41.622
What's happening?

09:41.706 --> 09:43.082
Oh, we flew here.

09:43.165 --> 09:45.585
-He doesn't intend to explain.
-He's Sukuna's vessel.

09:45.668 --> 09:48.087
So you're alive.

09:48.754 --> 09:51.841
We must ensure that Satoru Gojo
is unable to fight.

09:52.717 --> 09:57.096
You have to make Ryomen Sukuna
and Yuji Itadori your ally.

09:59.515 --> 10:02.184
For future considerations,
I can't kill Itadori.

10:02.268 --> 10:05.396
Did he find out about our goal?

10:06.022 --> 10:08.357
Who's that kid? Your shield?

10:08.441 --> 10:13.237
A shield? No.
I told you he's here to observe.

10:13.321 --> 10:16.365
I'm teaching this kid.

10:16.866 --> 10:19.493
Well, don't mind him. Just fight with me.

10:20.036 --> 10:24.874
It's stupid of you
to bring yourself a burden.

10:26.250 --> 10:27.960
It should be fine.

10:28.044 --> 10:29.295
Because…

10:29.378 --> 10:31.213
you're weak.

10:36.469 --> 10:38.554
Don't look down on me, brat!

10:38.638 --> 10:42.725
I'm going to swallow
your smiling face altogether!

10:48.814 --> 10:50.441
He said this guy…

10:50.524 --> 10:52.568
is weak?

10:54.362 --> 11:00.242
He's even more terrifying
than the monsters I've seen so far!

11:04.789 --> 11:06.332
It will be fine.

11:06.832 --> 11:08.668
Stay close to me.

11:12.588 --> 11:14.632
Domain Expansion.

11:29.522 --> 11:30.356
What?

11:38.906 --> 11:42.660
What is this?

11:43.744 --> 11:46.122
Coffin of the Iron Mountain.

11:53.170 --> 11:55.589
What is this?

11:56.465 --> 11:58.300
This is a Domain Expansion.

11:59.635 --> 12:02.930
-A domain built with cursed energy…
-It's hot!

12:03.013 --> 12:05.558
-…and enforced with sorcery.
-It's hot!

12:07.309 --> 12:09.895
What you guys experienced
in the juvenile detention center

12:09.979 --> 12:13.524
is an unfinished domain
without sorcery enforcement.

12:14.024 --> 12:17.194
If it was a proper domain,
all the freshmen would have been dead.

12:17.778 --> 12:19.697
I believe Megumi knew that.

12:21.323 --> 12:25.035
Domain Expansions uses
a lot of cursed energy.

12:25.119 --> 12:27.329
But it has its advantages as well.

12:27.413 --> 12:30.958
Firstly, the status under
environmental factors is increased.

12:31.041 --> 12:35.212
Oh, so it's like buffs in video games.

12:35.796 --> 12:37.173
Secondly…

12:40.676 --> 12:43.387
Ordinary Jujutsu Sorcerers
would have burned to ashes

12:43.471 --> 12:46.432
the moment they entered my domain.

12:46.515 --> 12:50.269
The sorcery technique
granted to them in the domain

12:50.352 --> 12:52.146
will definitely hit.

12:52.229 --> 12:53.397
Definitely?

12:53.481 --> 12:55.357
Definitely!

12:55.441 --> 12:58.694
Don't worry,
there are some countermeasures.

13:01.155 --> 13:03.699
You can fight it with sorcery,
like what I just did.

13:04.700 --> 13:06.911
I don't recommend the other method,

13:07.536 --> 13:09.538
which is to escape the domain.

13:09.622 --> 13:10.831
Normally, it's impossible.

13:10.915 --> 13:12.249
Also…

13:12.333 --> 13:16.420
If I neutralize your Infinity
with a more concentrated domain,

13:16.504 --> 13:18.547
my sorcery should probably hit you, right?

13:18.631 --> 13:20.299
Yes, it will hit.

13:20.382 --> 13:21.300
What? Infinity?

13:22.218 --> 13:24.220
Hand me the Prison Realm.

13:25.221 --> 13:27.097
I'm adding it to my collection.

13:28.098 --> 13:31.727
I came here half for fun.

13:32.311 --> 13:36.482
I thought it wouldn't matter
if I couldn't kill him.

13:36.565 --> 13:39.985
However, he showed me the difference
in power between the two of us.

13:40.069 --> 13:44.406
As a Cursed Spirit and a new human,

13:44.490 --> 13:46.992
I can't accept this!

13:47.993 --> 13:50.871
The most effective way
to fight against the domain

13:51.539 --> 13:53.666
is to use Domain Expansion ourselves, too.

13:53.749 --> 13:56.502
When both parties use Domain Expansion,

13:57.086 --> 14:00.506
the more refined sorcery
will gain the advantage.

14:00.589 --> 14:04.510
Although it also depends on
the compatibility and cursed energy level.

14:05.219 --> 14:10.266
Not even your ashes will be left,
Satoru Gojo!

14:16.564 --> 14:18.065
Domain Expansion.

14:21.193 --> 14:23.028
Unlimited Void.

14:47.386 --> 14:49.346
What happened?

14:50.097 --> 14:53.392
Was my domain defeated?

14:54.184 --> 14:57.730
I can't see nor feel anything.

14:58.647 --> 15:00.149
No.

15:00.232 --> 15:03.819
I can see and feel everything.

15:03.903 --> 15:07.156
All kinds of information are endless.

15:07.781 --> 15:11.452
Therefore, I can't do anything.

15:13.495 --> 15:15.998
This is the inside of limitless.

15:16.999 --> 15:19.168
Perception and communication…

15:19.752 --> 15:24.381
They force you to perform
countless actions called "survival."

15:25.966 --> 15:27.343
It's ironic, isn't it?

15:27.843 --> 15:31.388
You're given everything
but nothing can be done.

15:31.472 --> 15:33.891
-You can only die slowly.
-What?

15:34.516 --> 15:37.311
But I still have something to ask you.

15:37.394 --> 15:40.731
So I'll stop here.

15:56.038 --> 15:57.164
Well then…

15:57.790 --> 16:00.668
Who sent you here?

16:00.751 --> 16:03.963
This is the best Jujutsu Sorcerer?

16:04.463 --> 16:05.673
Even as living creatures…

16:06.465 --> 16:08.550
He's on a different level than me!

16:11.387 --> 16:12.638
Oh, man.

16:13.722 --> 16:14.932
What will you do?

16:15.516 --> 16:16.767
Will you save him?

16:17.977 --> 16:22.147
I can't be seen by anyone in the school.

16:22.856 --> 16:24.274
I'll go back first.

16:26.318 --> 16:29.196
If you want to save him, just go.

16:29.947 --> 16:33.575
Although I don't know
if you possess such emotions.

16:40.582 --> 16:42.042
How dare you.

16:42.126 --> 16:44.044
You're just a mere Cursed Spirit.

16:45.004 --> 16:48.132
Maybe it came by its own will.

16:49.091 --> 16:53.762
What's the point of killing me?

16:53.846 --> 16:57.016
Anyway, who's the opponent?

16:57.599 --> 16:59.977
Hey, tell me.

17:00.978 --> 17:03.981
Who would tell you, you darn brat?

17:04.064 --> 17:07.776
Is it really okay for you to say that?

17:08.485 --> 17:09.987
You bastard…

17:10.070 --> 17:13.073
Say it or I'll exorcise you.

17:13.157 --> 17:14.992
Although I still will after you confess.

17:15.075 --> 17:18.537
I didn't know Cursed Spirits could talk.

17:18.620 --> 17:20.581
It's so natural that I didn't realize it.

17:29.423 --> 17:32.009
-Flowers.
-It's so pretty.

17:34.094 --> 17:36.096
This is sorcery, right?

17:36.180 --> 17:37.723
It will reduce my fighting spirit.

17:44.480 --> 17:48.817
I'm okay! Go chase that guy!

17:50.277 --> 17:52.154
Sorry, I lied! Help!

17:57.785 --> 17:58.952
What?

17:59.536 --> 18:02.915
They escaped.
It's good in concealing its aura.

18:03.540 --> 18:07.294
This one is creepier
than that volcano head.

18:10.881 --> 18:12.257
I'm really sorry about that…

18:12.341 --> 18:15.094
Cursed Spirits of this caliber
are teaming up?

18:15.177 --> 18:17.763
-This is getting exciting.
-…but you brought me here.

18:17.846 --> 18:18.722
Yuji…

18:18.806 --> 18:19.681
No.

18:19.765 --> 18:23.519
I hope everyone gets strong enough
to deal with Cursed Spirits of that level.

18:24.144 --> 18:26.105
To deal with that?

18:26.188 --> 18:29.108
It's better to have
a specific goal in mind, right?

18:29.191 --> 18:31.944
Man, I'm glad I brought you along!

18:32.027 --> 18:34.738
I seriously have no idea what's going on.

18:34.822 --> 18:36.115
Is this guy for real?

18:36.198 --> 18:40.619
Once the goal is set,
all you need to do is to achieve it.

18:40.702 --> 18:42.454
Let's speed up our schedule.

18:42.538 --> 18:47.126
For the next month, you'll be watching
a movie while fighting with me.

18:47.209 --> 18:48.585
A fight with you?

18:50.003 --> 18:52.631
Will I still be alive one month later?

18:52.714 --> 18:54.800
After that,
you'll participate in real battles.

18:54.883 --> 18:57.469
I'll let you complete a few big missions.

18:57.553 --> 18:59.972
Basics and applications.

19:00.055 --> 19:03.600
After you've mastered it,
let's show off at the exchange program!

19:03.684 --> 19:05.018
Question, Mr. Gojo!

19:05.102 --> 19:06.562
Yes, Yuji?

19:06.645 --> 19:09.565
What's this exchange program?

19:09.648 --> 19:10.816
What?

19:11.400 --> 19:12.693
Didn't I tell you?

19:21.076 --> 19:22.286
He's late!

19:50.856 --> 19:52.524
It's so peaceful.

19:56.737 --> 19:59.198
How's Jogo, Geto?

20:00.240 --> 20:01.366
On the brink of death.

20:02.117 --> 20:05.662
Hanami went to save him,
so I think he should be fine.

20:05.746 --> 20:09.416
You're really irresponsible.
You instigated it, right?

20:09.917 --> 20:12.961
Of course not. I tried to stop him.

20:17.174 --> 20:18.592
Speak of the devil.

20:19.176 --> 20:21.094
Jogo, Hanami.

20:21.178 --> 20:23.847
I'm glad you guys are safe.

20:23.931 --> 20:26.850
How do I look safe?

20:28.143 --> 20:30.103
Be glad that this is all you got.

20:32.397 --> 20:34.399
You…

20:34.483 --> 20:36.568
You should understand now.

20:36.652 --> 20:40.113
Satoru Gojo needs to be
at the right time and place.

20:40.197 --> 20:44.284
Seal him under the premise that we have
established corresponding advantages.

20:44.868 --> 20:47.996
It will be executed in Shibuya
on 31st October.

20:48.622 --> 20:50.332
I'll inform you of the details later.

20:51.291 --> 20:53.252
Is that okay, Mahito?

20:53.335 --> 20:54.211
THE CLOUD GIANT

20:55.837 --> 20:57.214
No objections.

20:57.756 --> 20:59.174
Just act cunningly.

20:59.967 --> 21:01.176
Like a curse,

21:01.802 --> 21:03.303
and like a human.

22:35.937 --> 22:38.398
JUJU STROLL

22:38.482 --> 22:41.985
-One, two, three, four.
-One, two, three, four.

22:42.069 --> 22:43.320
What are you guys doing?

22:43.403 --> 22:44.446
Brazilian gymnastics.

22:44.529 --> 22:45.989
-Three, four.
-Three, four.

22:46.073 --> 22:47.783
I think we're done with the warm-ups.

22:47.866 --> 22:48.825
You're right.

22:49.951 --> 22:50.952
What?

22:51.036 --> 22:54.664
What are you guys planning to do?

22:54.748 --> 22:55.665
What?

23:03.632 --> 23:04.674
Geto!

23:12.182 --> 23:13.517
Mahito!

23:17.938 --> 23:20.357
Overhead…

23:32.744 --> 23:33.954
These guys…

23:34.037 --> 23:35.789
I'll kill them later!

23:35.872 --> 23:37.582
TOKYO PREFECTURAL JUJUTSU HIGH SCHOOL
